{
  "name": "BSM – Import automatique du planning (Gmail → site)",
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "google-email:TriggerNewEmail",
      "version": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "folder": "INBOX",
        "criteria": "ALL",
        "searchType": "simple",
        "from": "planning@bsmbasket.fr",
        "subject": "planning",
        "markSeen": false,
        "maxResults": 5
      },
      "mapper": {},
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
      "version": 1,
      "mapper": null,
      "metadata": {
        "designer": {
          "x": 300,
          "y": 0
        }
      },
      "routes": [
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 3,
              "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
              "version": 2,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "to": [
                  "planning@bsmbasket.fr"
                ],
                "subject": "Re: {{1.subject}}",
                "html": "<p>Bonjour,</p><p>0 match n'a été mis sur le site BSM : aucun fichier Excel (.xlsx) n'était joint à votre e-mail.</p><p>Merci de renvoyer l'e-mail avec le fichier du planning en pièce jointe (les anciens fichiers .xls doivent être réenregistrés en .xlsx).</p><p>— Import automatique du site BSM</p>",
                "attachments": [],
                "cc": [],
                "bcc": []
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 600,
                  "y": -300
                }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Planning sans pièce jointe .xlsx",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.subject}}",
                      "o": "text:contain:ci",
                      "b": "planning"
                    },
                    {
                      "a": "{{lower(join(map(1.attachments; \"fileName\"); \",\"))}}",
                      "o": "text:notcontain",
                      "b": ".xlsx"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 4,
              "module": "http:ActionSendData",
              "version": 3,
              "parameters": {
                "handleErrors": false,
                "useNewZLibDeCompress": true
              },
              "mapper": {
                "url": "https://bsmbasket.fr/api/auth/login",
                "method": "post",
                "headers": [],
                "qs": [],
                "bodyType": "raw",
                "contentType": "application/json",
                "data": "{\"username\": \"REMPLACER_PAR_ADMIN_USERNAME\", \"password\": \"REMPLACER_PAR_ADMIN_PASSWORD\"}",
                "parseResponse": true,
                "timeout": "60",
                "authUser": "",
                "authPass": "",
                "serializeUrl": false,
                "shareCookies": false,
                "followRedirect": true,
                "followAllRedirects": false,
                "useQuerystring": false,
                "gzip": true,
                "useMtls": false,
                "rejectUnauthorized": true,
                "ca": ""
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 600,
                  "y": 0
                }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "Planning avec pièce jointe .xlsx",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.subject}}",
                      "o": "text:contain:ci",
                      "b": "planning"
                    },
                    {
                      "a": "{{lower(join(map(1.attachments; \"fileName\"); \",\"))}}",
                      "o": "text:contain",
                      "b": ".xlsx"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              "onerror": [
                {
                  "id": 20,
                  "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
                  "version": 2,
                  "parameters": {},
                  "mapper": {
                    "to": [
                      "website@bsmbasket.fr"
                    ],
                    "subject": "[BSM import planning] Erreur système – connexion (get token)",
                    "html": "<p>L'import automatique du planning a échoué à l'étape <b>connexion (get token)</b>.</p><p>E-mail d'origine : « {{1.subject}} ».</p><p>Pas de réponse de https://bsmbasket.fr/api/auth/login : {{4.error.message}}</p><p>Le planning n'a pas été importé ; planning@ n'a reçu aucune réponse.</p>",
                    "attachments": [],
                    "cc": [],
                    "bcc": []
                  },
                  "metadata": {
                    "designer": {
                      "x": 600,
                      "y": 300
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": 21,
                  "module": "builtin:Ignore",
                  "version": 1,
                  "metadata": {
                    "designer": {
                      "x": 900,
                      "y": 300
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": 5,
              "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
              "version": 1,
              "mapper": null,
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 900,
                  "y": 0
                }
              },
              "routes": [
                {
                  "flow": [
                    {
                      "id": 6,
                      "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
                      "version": 2,
                      "parameters": {},
                      "mapper": {
                        "to": [
                          "website@bsmbasket.fr"
                        ],
                        "subject": "[BSM import planning] Erreur système – token refusé",
                        "html": "<p>L'appel <code>POST /api/auth/login</code> a répondu <b>{{4.statusCode}}</b> : <code>{{toString(4.data)}}</code></p><p>Vérifiez l'identifiant / mot de passe admin dans le module HTTP « login » du scénario Make.</p><p>E-mail d'origine : « {{1.subject}} ». Le planning n'a pas été importé.</p>",
                        "attachments": [],
                        "cc": [],
                        "bcc": []
                      },
                      "metadata": {
                        "designer": {
                          "x": 1200,
                          "y": -300
                        }
                      },
                      "filter": {
                        "name": "Token refusé",
                        "conditions": [
                          [
                            {
                              "a": "{{4.statusCode}}",
                              "o": "number:notequal",
                              "b": "200"
                            }
                          ]
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "flow": [
                    {
                      "id": 7,
                      "module": "builtin:BasicFeeder",
                      "version": 1,
                      "mapper": {
                        "array": "{{1.attachments}}"
                      },
                      "filter": {
                        "name": "Token obtenu",
                        "conditions": [
                          [
                            {
                              "a": "{{4.statusCode}}",
                              "o": "number:equal",
                              "b": "200"
                            }
                          ]
                        ]
                      },
                      "metadata": {
                        "designer": {
                          "x": 1200,
                          "y": 0
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": 8,
                      "module": "http:ActionSendData",
                      "version": 3,
                      "parameters": {
                        "handleErrors": false,
                        "useNewZLibDeCompress": true
                      },
                      "mapper": {
                        "url": "https://bsmbasket.fr/api/matches/import",
                        "method": "post",
                        "headers": [
                          {
                            "name": "Authorization",
                            "value": "Bearer {{4.data.token}}"
                          }
                        ],
                        "qs": [],
                        "bodyType": "raw",
                        "contentType": "application/json",
                        "data": "{\"filename\": \"{{7.fileName}}\", \"contentBase64\": \"{{base64(7.data)}}\"}",
                        "parseResponse": true,
                        "timeout": "60",
                        "authUser": "",
                        "authPass": "",
                        "serializeUrl": false,
                        "shareCookies": false,
                        "followRedirect": true,
                        "followAllRedirects": false,
                        "useQuerystring": false,
                        "gzip": true,
                        "useMtls": false,
                        "rejectUnauthorized": true,
                        "ca": ""
                      },
                      "metadata": {
                        "designer": {
                          "x": 1500,
                          "y": 0
                        }
                      },
                      "filter": {
                        "name": "Fichier .xlsx",
                        "conditions": [
                          [
                            {
                              "a": "{{lower(7.fileName)}}",
                              "o": "text:contain",
                              "b": ".xlsx"
                            }
                          ]
                        ]
                      },
                      "onerror": [
                        {
                          "id": 22,
                          "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
                          "version": 2,
                          "parameters": {},
                          "mapper": {
                            "to": [
                              "website@bsmbasket.fr"
                            ],
                            "subject": "[BSM import planning] Erreur système – import du fichier",
                            "html": "<p>L'import automatique du planning a échoué à l'étape <b>import du fichier</b>.</p><p>E-mail d'origine : « {{1.subject}} ».</p><p>Pas de réponse de https://bsmbasket.fr/api/matches/import pour « {{7.fileName}} » : {{8.error.message}}</p><p>Le planning n'a pas été importé ; planning@ n'a reçu aucune réponse.</p>",
                            "attachments": [],
                            "cc": [],
                            "bcc": []
                          },
                          "metadata": {
                            "designer": {
                              "x": 1500,
                              "y": 300
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "id": 23,
                          "module": "builtin:Ignore",
                          "version": 1,
                          "metadata": {
                            "designer": {
                              "x": 1800,
                              "y": 300
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": 9,
                      "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
                      "version": 1,
                      "mapper": null,
                      "metadata": {
                        "designer": {
                          "x": 1800,
                          "y": 0
                        }
                      },
                      "routes": [
                        {
                          "flow": [
                            {
                              "id": 10,
                              "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
                              "version": 2,
                              "parameters": {},
                              "mapper": {
                                "to": [
                                  "planning@bsmbasket.fr"
                                ],
                                "subject": "Re: {{1.subject}}",
                                "html": "{{8.data.reportHtml}}",
                                "attachments": [],
                                "cc": [],
                                "bcc": []
                              },
                              "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                  "x": 2100,
                                  "y": -300
                                }
                              },
                              "filter": {
                                "name": "Rapport pour planning@ (200 ou 422)",
                                "conditions": [
                                  [
                                    {
                                      "a": "{{8.statusCode}}",
                                      "o": "number:equal",
                                      "b": "200"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  [
                                    {
                                      "a": "{{8.statusCode}}",
                                      "o": "number:equal",
                                      "b": "422"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "flow": [
                            {
                              "id": 11,
                              "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
                              "version": 2,
                              "parameters": {},
                              "mapper": {
                                "to": [
                                  "website@bsmbasket.fr"
                                ],
                                "subject": "[BSM import planning] Erreur système – matchs non enregistrés",
                                "html": "{{8.data.systemReportHtml}}",
                                "attachments": [],
                                "cc": [],
                                "bcc": []
                              },
                              "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                  "x": 2100,
                                  "y": 0
                                }
                              },
                              "filter": {
                                "name": "Erreurs base de données sur certains matchs",
                                "conditions": [
                                  [
                                    {
                                      "a": "{{8.statusCode}}",
                                      "o": "number:equal",
                                      "b": "200"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "a": "{{8.data.hasSystemErrors}}",
                                      "o": "boolean:equal",
                                      "b": "true"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "flow": [
                            {
                              "id": 12,
                              "module": "google-email:ActionSendEmail",
                              "version": 2,
                              "parameters": {},
                              "mapper": {
                                "to": [
                                  "website@bsmbasket.fr"
                                ],
                                "subject": "[BSM import planning] Erreur système – import refusé ({{8.statusCode}})",
                                "html": "<p>L'appel <code>POST /api/matches/import</code> pour « {{7.fileName}} » a répondu <b>{{8.statusCode}}</b> : <code>{{toString(8.data)}}</code></p><p>E-mail d'origine : « {{1.subject}} ». Le planning n'a pas été importé ; planning@ n'a reçu aucune réponse.</p>",
                                "attachments": [],
                                "cc": [],
                                "bcc": []
                              },
                              "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                  "x": 2100,
                                  "y": 300
                                }
                              },
                              "filter": {
                                "name": "Autre statut (erreur système)",
                                "conditions": [
                                  [
                                    {
                                      "a": "{{8.statusCode}}",
                                      "o": "number:notequal",
                                      "b": "200"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "a": "{{8.statusCode}}",
                                      "o": "number:notequal",
                                      "b": "422"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "instant": false,
    "version": 1,
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": true,
      "confidential": true,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    },
    "designer": {
      "orphans": []
    }
  }
}
